{# The #filter-status fragment: what the text currently in the box would select. Rendered on
   every (debounced) keystroke by /filter/preview, and again on commit -- both go through
   `render.filter_status`, so the preview can never disagree with the result.

   `lines` are Markup built server-side; the unrecognised-entry text inside them is escaped
   user input. #}
{% for line in lines %}
<div class="filter-line">{{ line }}</div>
{% endfor %}
